Package: com.parv.octopusbridge
Name: OctopusBridge
Depends: mobilesubstrate, com.parv.octopus (>= 0.5)
Version: 0.5.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Bridges the ptpd PTP responder to the Octopus iPhone file manager.
 Injects into ptpd on iOS 17 and registers Octopus as a second PTP storage volume.
 Requires the Octopus app to be running. Verifies the ptpd binary UUID before
 installing any hooks — will silently unload on an unrecognised build.
Maintainer: Parv Tahiliani <pat113@pitt.edu>
Section: Tweaks
Tag: compatible_min::ios=17.0, role::tweak, purpose::file-transfer
